abstract: >-
  Benchmark loaders and research code accompanying Toward Collective Model
  Intelligence: Characterizing and Coordinating Models. Includes RobustRouteBench
  loading, ORBIT-compatible routing adapters, offline quality-cost evaluation,
  and experimental results.
